---
id: AD-Persetujuan-CutiTukarShift
title: Activity Diagram - Persetujuan Cuti dan Tukar Shift
---
flowchart TD
  A([Mulai]) --> B[Manager/HR buka menu Persetujuan]
  B --> C{Jenis persetujuan}

  C -- Cuti --> D[Lihat daftar cuti pending]
  D --> E[Buka detail pengajuan]
  E --> F{Keputusan}
  F -- Approve --> G[Update status approved]
  F -- Reject --> H[Isi alasan dan update rejected]
  G --> I[Kirim notifikasi ke pegawai]
  H --> I
  I --> D

  C -- Tukar Shift --> J[Lihat daftar request pending]
  J --> K[Buka detail request]
  K --> L{Keputusan}
  L -- Approve --> M[Update approved]
  L -- Reject --> N[Update rejected]
  M --> O{Aksi lanjutan}
  O -- Execute --> P[Eksekusi pertukaran jadwal]
  O -- Revert --> Q[Rollback pertukaran]
  O -- Kembali --> J
  P --> J
  Q --> J
  N --> J

  C -- Selesai --> Z([Selesai])
